<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Surprise Party, 1989</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=6&gt;&lt;U&gt;SURPRISE PARTY&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=left&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=left&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;UNITED STATES vs. SOVIET UNION&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;DATE/TIME:&lt;/STRONG&gt; 28TH OCTOBER, 1989 / 07:00 ZULU / 07:00 JULIET&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;
&lt;P align=left&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;LOCATION:&lt;/STRONG&gt; ATLANTIC OCEAN&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;PLAYABLE SIDES:&lt;/STRONG&gt; USA, USSR&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;EM&gt;A U.S. Navy convoy need to move off of Atlantic Ocean to reach the Norwegian Sea. After days of traveling the open seas, the Americans are tired and anxious for a quiet walk on the coast of the Continental Europe.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;What they do not imagine, is that the Soviets placed the nefarious hot rod from the seas on their way. The ultra-fast and implacable Alfa-class submarine.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;688&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;EM&gt;The war is heating up. NATO is sending a large battle group to the Norwegian Sea from the south in support of their current forces. The Norwegian Sea is of vital significance to both sides - it represent the only access the Soviet Northern Fleet has to the Atlantic Ocean. If NATO can keep the Soviet Northern Fleet "bottled up" in its home ports, American and European shipping can continue delivering preciously needed arms and supplies with minimum harassment. Your orders are to escort the reinforcements to the north and protect them from Soviet attack.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;ALFA&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Your orders are to patrol your sector and proceed to attack any enemy vessels you encounter. You stumble onto a large battle group and most single-handely engage the American ships. Good luck.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;*-*-*-*&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Author's notes.&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;In the game 688 Attack Sub, the Soviet Alfa submarine is named "Leninskii Komsomol". In fact, the only Soviet boat with that name was the K-3 Leninsky Komsomol, an old November-class (PLA-627 Kit) submarine which was launched in 1957, commissioned in 1958 and decommissioned in 1988, one year before the 688 Attack Sub game hit the market. The seven real Soviet Alfa-class (PLA-705 Lira) boats, including the first problematic one, were named on following order: K-64, K-123, K-316, K-432, K-373, K-493 and K-463.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;The Soviet messages in the original game (for IBM PC and Commodore Amiga versions. Not in the Sega Genesis/Mega Drive version) abuse of the letters in cyrillic while retaining the english words. I tried to imitate it and added&amp;nbsp;the messages without cyrillic letters for your better understanding.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;On the original 688 game, the american convoy is not realistic. The U.S. Navy&amp;nbsp;hardly leaves the Nimitz-class carrier, including the Iowa-class battleship,&amp;nbsp;without the necessary escorts, which would include at least two Oliver Hazard Perry-class frigates and some Spruance-class destroyers for prosecuting hostile submarines. I kept the convoy as in the original game, but with better air cover against submarines. The main objective remains to sink the aircraft carrier.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;*-*-*-*&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;v1.1 by CassioM (TUE-09/02/14)&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;- Changed the scoring system. Now, you need to destroy only the Nimitz to win this scenario.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;*-*-*-*&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;This is a improved remake of the Surprise Party scenario from the game 688 Attack Sub launched by John W. Ratcliff and Electronic Arts in 1989.&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Original texts and mission concept by John W. Ratcliff - 1988. All rights reserved.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;CMANO remake &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;by CassioM - 2014 (SUN-08/17/14) - v1.0&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
